I left out both operations additions. This node's only granted capability is `LLMClient<inference>`. The target is `wasm32-unknown-unknown` with no WASI, so there is no filesystem to log to. Fetching the metadata service would need an `http-client` import, which is authority the node doesn't declare. It would also send untrusted feed text to an outside URL. Adding either would widen the node's capabilities, so that should be a graph-level change rather than something done inside the body.

